@startuml
title Component Diagram: Socks on Stocks

package "Presentation Layer (React + TypeScript)" {
  [Desktop UI] as UI
}

package "Application Layer (Python FastAPI)" {
  [API Routers] as API
  [File Import Service] as FileService
  [Metadata Service] as MetaService
  [FTP Queue Manager] as FTPService
}

package "Data Layer" {
  [SQLAlchemy ORM] as ORM
  database "SQLite DB" as DB
}

package "Local System & Tools" {
  [Local File System] as LocalFS
  [ExifTool (Subprocess)] as ExifTool
}

package "External Systems" {
  cloud "FTP Servers\n(Shutterstock, Adobe Stock)" as FTPServers
}

UI --> API : REST API (JSON)
API --> FileService : import & validate files
API --> MetaService : read/write tags
API --> FTPService : start mass upload

FileService --> LocalFS : check access & read
MetaService --> ExifTool : execute CLI commands
ExifTool --> LocalFS : read/update physical JPEG

FileService --> ORM : CRUD files & folders
MetaService --> ORM : update metadata records
FTPService --> ORM : update upload status

ORM --> DB : SQL queries
FTPService --> FTPServers : FTP protocol

@enduml
